  "description": "Program\nThe First Allround is the easy and versatile board to start paddleboarding, offering flexibility from cruising to surfing.\nPrésentation\nCompact, quickly inflated, and easy to handle on all types of water, the First Allround has everything you need for hassle-free sessions, whether cruising or surfing.\nDelivered as a complete pack, it includes all the accessories you need to hit the water!\nA First Allround SUP board in the size and color of your choice.\nA 3-piece adjustable aluminum paddle, easy to store in the board bag.\nAn ankle leash suited to the board’s size.\nA double action pump for quick and effortless inflation.\nAn easy-to-install center fin.\nA comfortable, lightweight bag to carry it all.\nGlide effortlessly on flat water with the First Allround, featuring outstanding rigidity and an outline designed by our shaper, with over 30 years of experience and thousands of shapes.\nIts subtly raised, streamlined nose handles waves and chop with ease. The ideal board for beginners—it’s quick to learn and packed with fun!\nWhere it really shines is in the waves: incredibly playful, tons of fun, and surprisingly high-performing SUP surfing becomes effortless on small, smooth swells. You’ll get into waves early, and the board responds intuitively, carrying you all the way to the beach.\nPositioning on the wave at takeoff is effortless, and the raised nose adds a reassuring touch. Once you’re in, it’s fast and lively, especially in the small conditions you’ll often encounter.\nLight and smooth, it delivers top performance whether surfing or cruising on flat water.\nWe offer it in four sizes to suit all body types and activities: 8’0, 9’0, 10’0, and 11’0.\nThe First Allround Junior 8’0 is specially designed for kids aged 5 to 13, ensuring the best possible SUP experience. At 74 cm wide, it allows young riders to paddle efficiently and in a straight line, with zero balance issues. It’s also ideal for very lightweight paddlers (up to 50 kg) who want a versatile SUP—ultra-maneuverable for surfing, more controlled, and with reduced wind resistance due to its slimmer profile.\nThe First Allround 9’0 is designed for lighter paddlers (up to 75/80kg) seeking a versatile, lightweight, and quick-to-inflate Stand Up Paddle board. The perfect combination of simplicity and fun.\nThe First Allround 10’0 is intended for medium-sized paddlers (70/90kg) who want an ultra-versatile, lightweight, and accessible Stand Up Paddle board. The perfect surf/cruise compromise.\nThe First Allround 11’0 is a comfortable family board, lightweight for its size, and easy to use. The perfect surf/cruise compromise for larger paddlers or for bringing a child and a picnic along.",
  "meta_description": "The inflatable paddleboard for everything: stable, rigid, lightweight and at a great price!",
